  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9TYytCO.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"189\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kc2YGgk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/554379889122213888.svg?label=加入我們的Discord&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Tools 是 Mekanism 的官方附加組件，為各種 Mekanism 材料以及部分原版材料添加工具和盔甲。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>包含以下材料的盔甲、盾牌和工具（包括鎬斧鏟三合一工具）：</p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">青銅</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">青金石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">鋨</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">精製螢石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">精製黑曜石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">鋼</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">此外還包含原版工具類型的鎬斧鏟三合一工具：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">木</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">石</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">鐵</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">金</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">鑽石</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">其他 Mekanism 模組的連結：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Additions</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Generators</span></a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>文檔</strong>可在 Mekanism 的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwiki.aidancbrady.com%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 wiki</a> 上找到，由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.indiewikis.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">IndieWikis</a> 熱情託管！該 wiki 仍在建設中，如果您有餘力，請務必貢獻一份力量！</p><p><strong>源代碼</strong>可在 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/mekanism-mod/Mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong> 上取得！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>透過 Patreon 支援團隊</strong>：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=260704\" rel=\"nofollow\">aidancbrady</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/pupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>透過 Ko-fi 支援團隊</strong>：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>",
